# ── TravelStar app (Expo) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Only EXPO_PUBLIC_*-prefixed vars are readable from app code, and they are
# BAKED INTO THE BUNDLE at build time. Never put a secret here.
#
# For EAS builds this is set per build profile in eas.json
# (development / preview / production), not from this file. This file is
# for `npx expo start` on a machine where the dev-server host sniffing in
# src/services/api.ts resolves to the wrong address.
#
# Required for any non-__DEV__ build: resolveApiBaseUrl() throws without it
# rather than silently falling back to a loopback address that is
# unreachable for every real user (docs/REMEDIATION.md §6.1).
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
